<div class="page-head"><div><h1><%= review.kind==='price'?'Review selling prices':review.kind==='restore'?'Restore selected products':'Archive selected products' %></h1><p><%= review.status==='COMPLETED'?'These reviewed changes are complete.':'Review the exact scope. Nothing changes until you approve.' %></p></div></div>
<section class="card card-body"><% if(review.kind==='price'){ %><div class="table-scroll"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Product / variant</th><th>SKU</th><th>Current</th><th>New</th></tr></thead><tbody><% review.payload.changes.forEach(function(c){ %><tr><td><%= c.name %></td><td><%= c.code %></td><td><%= c.before %></td><td><%= c.after %></td></tr><% }); %></tbody></table></div><p>Existing completed transactions retain their historical prices. Connected channels may receive these changes under synchronization policies you already approved.</p><% }else{ %><ul><% review.payload.items.forEach(function(i){ %><li><%= i.name %></li><% }); %></ul><p>Archiving retains history and requires zero stock. Restoring makes the same product and its history active again. No stock, cash or inventory cost is created.</p><% } %>
<% if(review.status==='PENDING'){ %><form method="post" action="/inventory/bulk/reviews/<%= review.id %>/approve"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="integrityHash" value="<%= review.integrity_hash %>"><button class="btn btn--primary" type="submit">Approve all listed changes</button></form><form method="post" action="/inventory/bulk/reviews/<%= review.id %>/cancel"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><button class="btn" type="submit">Cancel these changes</button></form><% } %><p><a href="/inventory/table">Back to stock table</a></p></section>
